Commands under `ledgers bills`

Usage: bills <COMMAND>

Commands:
  confirm         bills.confirm
  create          bills.create
  discard         bills.discard
  extract         bills.extract
  get             bills.get
  list            bills.list
  post            bills.post
  propose-entry   bills.propose-entry
  record-payment  bills.record-payment
  update          bills.update
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
